cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this site or its download files, please cite it as below, and cite the
  surveys, brokers and classifiers whose data you use (listed on the site's Data page).
title: "TNS × EDP2 Explorer: lightcurves of TNS transients in the Rubin EDP2 footprint"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tang
    given-names: "Xianzhe TZ"
repository-code: "https://github.com/trivialTZ/tns-edp2-explorer"
url: "https://trivialtz.github.io/tns-edp2-explorer/"
abstract: >-
  A static browser of the 9,330 Transient Name Server transients discovered between
  2025-02-24 and 2026-01-07 inside the Rubin Observatory EDP2 visit footprint: TNS,
  ZTF (ALeRCE) and public Rubin alert (Fink) photometry on one flux scale, TNS spectra,
  sky images and alert cutouts, broker and metaDEBASS classifications, and bulk
  downloads. Proprietary Rubin DP2 data are included only as ciphertext.
keywords:
  - transients
  - supernovae
  - Rubin Observatory
  - LSST
  - Transient Name Server
  - light curves
version: "2026.09.24"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
